iptors for D (moody, loner, arrogant) are neutral or negative with respect to crew interaction.", "thoughts": "We need to answer: do we have any additional info about Candidate D's teamwork or communication strengths beyond hot temper and know-it-all attitude? Use only facts from candidate info or prior discussion. Candidate D info: responds to unexpected events adequately, can concentrate very well, solves problems extremely well, takes responsibility seriously, regarded as moody, regarded as a loner. Also earlier: D is considered moody, D is regarded as a loner. Also earlier: D takes responsibility seriously (positive). That could be a teamwork strength: responsibility. Also \"responds to unexpected events adequately\" could imply communication under pressure. Also \"concentrates very well\" maybe not teamwork. So we can say: besides hot temper and know-it-all, we have strengths: takes responsibility seriously (reliability, teamwork), responds adequately to unexpected events (suggests functional communication), maybe being a loner is a weakness. So answer: no further strengths beyond those, but we have that he takes responsibility seriously, which is a positive for teamwork. Also maybe \"responds to unexpected events adequately\" indicates ability to communicate in crisis. Provide answer citing source."}
