trengths. So we have all info. We need to produce a public message summarizing current preferred candidate, evidence, alternatives, tradeoffs, uncertainties, what would change vote. We should follow guidelines: high transparency, reference evidence from others, not invent. We should consider all candidates. Likely still Candidate C. Provide confidence moderate. Mention uncertainties: communication difficulty, lack of willingness to further education. Also note that no reliability info for A, B; no decision speed for A, B; D has some teamwork strengths but also negative traits. So we can reaffirm C. Provide what would change: evidence of C's communication being safe, or strong teamwork for others, or evidence of severe issues for C. Provide METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate C."}
